DESCRIPTION:https://events.stanford.edu/event/first-fridays-at-ida-social\n
 \nJoin us at Harmony House for IDA’s monthly First Fridays! A gathering 
 space for artists\, students\, and community to connect\, unwind\, and cre
 ate together. Each month\, we open our doors at the Harmony House  for an 
 evening of conversation\, art-making\, and chill vibes over food and drink
 s. Whether you’re here to meet new people\, share your work\, or just ha
 ng out\, First Fridays are a chance to slow down and be in creative commun
 ity.
